Passed through \code{\link[parsnip:set_engine]{parsnip::set_engine()}}:
\itemize{
\item \code{method}: PLS algorithm for \code{\link[pls:mvr]{pls::mvr()}}, one of \code{"kernelpls"} (default),
\code{"widekernelpls"}, \code{"simpls"}, \code{"oscorespls"}.
\item \code{scale}: if \code{TRUE}, predictors are scaled to unit variance before the
fit. Default \code{FALSE} (predictors are only centred), as in \code{\link[pls:plsr]{pls::plsr()}};
note that the \code{"mixOmics"} engine scales by default. Scaling can also be
